  Speech Synthesis Database (Yamagishi, Honnet, Garner, Lazaridis,
  2017, University of Edinburgh, CC BY 4.0) ; modèle de base Hi-Fi
  TTS (CC BY 4.0). Détails : voices\siwis\SOURCE.txt.
{CREDIT_PIERRE}  Synthèse : Piper (piper1-gpl 1.8.0, GPL-3.0-or-later), espeak-ng
